# ==============================================================================
# OUTFIT THEORY — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
#
# NOTE: ZERO external API credentials are required to run this application!
# The application runs fully functional out of the box in test-ready development mode.
# All external payment and WhatsApp integrations are completely optional.
#
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. ATELIER SECURITY & ADMIN ACCESS (OPTIONAL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The passcode used to access the protected Atelier Admin Console.
# If omitted, it defaults to: "atelier2025"
ADMIN_PASSCODE="atelier2025"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. PAYMENT GATEWAY INTEGRATION (OPTIONAL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# By default, the application runs in test-ready mode and displays:
# "Payment gateway not configured" in the admin dashboard until keys are provided.
#
# To connect live Razorpay payments:
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=""
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=""
#
# Or to connect live Cashfree payments:
# CASHFREE_APP_ID=""
# CASHFREE_SECRET_KEY=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. WHATSAPP BUSINESS CLOUD API INTEGRATION (OPTIONAL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# By default, the application runs with direct concierge dispatch and local logging,
# displaying "WhatsApp integration not configured" until Meta Cloud API keys are provided.
#
# To connect automated WhatsApp Cloud API dispatch:
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_ID=""
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=""
# WHATSAPP_OWNER_PHONE="919611623514"
